// A day we could make possible: one fictional, optimistic day in four
// moments, each traced back to today's barriers and a first experiment.
// It is a design fiction to discuss, change or reject, written by the demo
// authors from research/2026-09-restart/A-DAY-WE-COULD-MAKE-POSSIBLE.md.
// Nothing here is generated by the AI, live activity or a measured result.
//
// Earlier versions of this view compared three economic models; that text
// is in git history (this file at commit 825466e). Old deep links to those
// models are answered truthfully below rather than redirected silently.

import { h } from '../dom.js';

